'' PACKAGES (ADR 0017; RFC-0007). proj/tiko.toml names the root package 'app', with two path
'' dependencies. 'app/util' is found as the current package (§3, source 2), 'mylib/core' and
'' 'other/core' through the manifest's [dependencies] (source 3) -- two modules named core, in
'' two packages, linked into one program with no collision, since the chains differ. The
'' package's [defines] reach its modules (util sees APP_FLAG) and not the root; the root's
'' [dependencies.mylib.defines] overrides mylib's own LIB_LEVEL, 1, with 3.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/modules/src/pkg/proj/main.bas -o tests/modules/packagelink.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/packagelink.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  3
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  2
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: main: no APP_FLAG
